  "description": "LeMP is an open-source Lisp-inspired macro processor for C#. It helps you avoid writing boilerplate and repetitive code, and it provides a framework in which you can run code-generation algorithms at compile-time.\n    \n    This is the library version! The command-line tool package is called LeMP-Tool. Or, to integrate LeMP into Visual Studio, please download a release from https://github.com/qwertie/ecsharp/releases",
